### docker-compose variable overrides — machine-specific (e.g. LIVEKIT_NODE_IP
### is whatever LAN IP *this* host is reached on). Anchored to the repo root so
### the committed web/.env.development / web/.env.production still apply. ###
/.env

### Ignored modules (leading slash = repo root ONLY; a bare `service/` also matches
### nested packages like voice/.../application/service/ and hides real code) ###
/library/
/metrics/
/payment/
/service/
/trading/
/transmission/

